      title: "tencent.com"
    }
    summary: "\"linzixuanzz/daidai-panel,\" also known as \"\345\221\206\345\221\206\351\235\242\346\235\277,\" is a lightweight scheduled task management panel that incorporates AppKey, AppSecret, and environment variables as key features.\n\nHere\'s how these elements are utilized:\n*   **AppKey / AppSecret**: The Daidai Panel supports Open API with App Key and App Secret authentication, allowing for integration with third-party systems[1][2].\n*   **\347\216\257\345\242\203\345\217\230\351\207\217 (Environment Variables)**: The panel includes a dedicated section for managing environment variables. This feature allows for grouped management, drag-and-drop sorting, and supports batch import and export, with compatibility for the Qinglong panel\'s format[1][2]. Sensitive environment variables are automatically detected and masked before being displayed or logged for security purposes[3]. Environment variables are crucial for configuring scripts, installing dependencies, and setting up Cron execution times within the panel[4].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHgh03m-13SsZ0z9yDBV2vZNYr8f5-tTI9cqfeCzEtFNEmLUhw36ZKAJMrKSqv5SAf08Xe8zk9_vlh7-K9dk1-b62474IHHeUPFecz6J9pUmRP_CVGlPHIm4R9r2QVFLyCOOT8UVeM=)\n[2] [csdn.net](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEnwjdtBt3oaRdaJhCXDr10PtVfQfX4x075S1Zjjt_z4ci75ZrmT8-QO38H3ckqCi7uoZxSGzzQgaHAJd_pre3rIhHSylpZM2XSOUKSXfu253ZDG6lUv7zBjrFI5aQZYOx_yX4FHGj76IYsmA_naZPWA1i66hPp)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHEAoRls0R9nvSYrCEqaU3wmA3VoQnL6Cultn3nGkXH0VgYTVrxVy0CZhzkvuvVGuFEvuQ-35NeUEz3VfQSwuLKnnuBx02pgR5eKZiZlwh9Lgm7vn_2HpruuGhei2H6ZPvtGWyG-EqAsLyS_P0RAu72Vw==)\n[4] [tencent.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG6hsgJHoufLGL50mhQW_8qZrCyP7j3n8CxL6a9j15mlvQg4MoK4eHJAJsWt3kK7Ry-vQkPI7vGa61GdlF9GkV0RX_P90JNGDhCTvK4dSnG7_Xo6DbLpKLDBafjKUyxY1eUqlYO8nlofKxKk