    summary: "The search results provided general information about the OpenAPI Specification, but did not specifically search within the `github.com/linzixuanzz/daidai-panel` repository for the requested keywords. This indicates that the initial search query might have been too broad or that the Google Search API interpreted the `site:` operator in a way that focused on the general meaning of \"OpenAPI\" rather than a targeted repository search.\n\nTo directly address the user\'s request of finding these keywords within the specified GitHub repository, I need to refine the search. Instead of relying on `site:`, I will construct a query that explicitly includes the GitHub repository URL and the keywords.\n\nSources:\n[1] [swagger.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHU1FryGRBssA1eIfG_4X568TvNSl8GOMISujJsgivU8D_DFIOt7QMDOQvkm6E-IC2mz2lVixdSfW3fmdlIebVaF2ChYNTxomxJdekVHkUT-jFM080a3MApVOoQEDmuyCLo)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGwqchipdyuHGQA5UB3rzqxY8lLCbfCfFc96ix6pYnvUjptuc2dT1ntWlQI4qVXTFNWzr6c6gHGs6BhqDw2NqM3HQtUK9k46_7lrawo3zYyT7tiYBIhQP8py4Pt2TJwbqmYaQ6NcYyf)\n[3] [wikipedia.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHSLCB-phl--pwn-R1zH7-mAsv5f3R6Z8BBNwKiPVYFAJ6AmlcG29_wK8SqWRLJGtqIn5HsPn2JimjR74PwuyXbceG7CcUwdQQxDGIMd0X5Rqu-zqKfITPeeN1ToqqhQa0cA58HYUAkydT4fDxnKA==)\n[4] [swagger.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGyx7Zu7peThRmKvBy--rH5k4J9yB6C9ogZcpGC0H_e1TepVCBurt4jKDAx4K1pmOdlpdFLrtDnUh6sBEog19ixEE5YKRLmNs5yp1K603sO1V9RjV2TB8UG006WKBJleRnNR80bk0tP2RkRrns=)\n[5] [openapis.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGunXuFHHpyDK2j0RXPqKLyj_eSg7evujAbaFJN3ChZzsLkG30tGhZOp-CoXC5JwXrKV8hmmQ5kek_QPklnzjyV_ZLwvsQ4xokLYhLOHQ-pY3jNdNo=)"
