      title: "docker.com"
    }
    summary: "\"daidai-panel\" is a lightweight scheduled task management panel developed by \"linzixuanzz\" that provides functionalities related to APIs, tokens, and environment variables.\n\nKey findings include:\n*   **API**: The Daidai Panel offers an \"Open API\" for integration with third-party systems, utilizing App Key and App Secret for authentication[1]. It also provides a `script-api.md` documentation, indicating an API for managing scripts[2]. Specific API endpoints mentioned include `GET /api/tasks/labels` and `POST /api/v1/open-api/token` for obtaining an application token[3][4].\n*   **Token**: Tokens play a role in authenticating with the Open API, with application tokens obtained via the `POST /api/v1/open-api/token` endpoint having a 24-hour validity[4]. There are also mentions of `DEMO_TOKEN` in script examples[2] and `WATCHTOWER_HTTP_API_TOKEN` for integrating with Watchtower[1][5].\n*   **Environment Variables (env)**: The panel supports comprehensive management of environment variables, including grouping, drag-and-drop sorting, masking of sensitive values, and batch import/export, with compatibility for the Qinglong panel format[1][5]. An example environment file, `.env.watchtower.prod.example`, is available[6]. Docker images for the panel also define environment variables such as `LANG`, `LC_ALL`, and `PANEL_PORT`[7]. Specific environment variables like `WATCHTOWER_HTTP_API_PERIODIC_POLLS` and `WATCHTOWER_HTTP_API_ENDPOINTS` are used for configuring Watchtower integration[1][5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEOF7Q_AFJ1Kt05s_ac_CoYw1jsY1YG0eXb1GiJdPP989ehsrgkmftPjHGnJHHRW87H-u0PIyg-wQMTj5j9uBX_ajhxAttHtTkQVgk8uF3Z0dIpKhxw3yTuNcHFPCqROz3s3d0wfQ8=)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEypfC6bI1bm7qQSRWanxO0hNXJiSBinNbYO8HrdXYBtOXKxZ2C1fch9IPEPHGyOcLstgP0pxPAqWOLo34IYh56p8NU1pppYlzdK985vrku0Q_bMSyFHZnghKItJkj6DYgtOniQqoiQaOO2FUayMpj_CMk3ioUo7KshpasGeVjZg_XpQg==)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEAAIXa8g66fIl6RzJAFraZGDYPa6QnSl96cSTetIGNuPNAi1UOQOGbL5MdUTAS03uTdU7OuSFeK64UrWGmH4anBL94OECOZL-AZ5UEOBIuT6fX6Cdiwpp-gIOfWLBrEiiE4gtVfffa1cJjDz6ZiSE=)\n[4] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEnLXFAPlhf0BhWOyBPzLHYe4CMliX5_ozABFv2J8A9go9zhp6AVfv1YW_DT6KY1jkHZ5-HlaV9PcJgmVaMTwDk9FV9734R49gQoOVRDcUd_iX3SA5HRYzx67Opw81a5P2ssTrxSU9M7ZGALqjrQzlJTOP1h5Q8zzVzz_G2)\n[5] [csdn.net](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE9ovV35XnZdy4z-g8po-N8u78T62uHjzvKd_7Q_PA_0ArFBS4nZEoHHlb-Cy_8GyHDKSZCpRcp-eQYO1cmVICQxQwzcKqyhwJn_n4x0eJLMt1HJ2O4de8DmoorBdWBAYfVTm42ti15b-Qb-j1ayIdiOpi5h1po1g==)\n[6] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH5jJzhaj8pZthU7VE6reCUujn67lLuMM_H0K8JqB8C09vNsNWVptcszs7bU33p0JpOJ1zaZFMw4_aVzgqXSeyamECJFuknBBKIr0la5COmzC8UfcW0zouKElqnUV1HLgAii9OrWQjT1JEx6WIfpTV7buy2ZOdsqyiqFum87s7E7BPiR0heonn06GP2EwU=)\n[7] [docker.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHKQXlcGhq2216_0dzuG-fJ5KRess82H5ZlIQIuHkfH9DtzmUzbS88v5BHglWQXvSbYUpIKQiRAtkkdKHauEXPeuk8ubrWuyObAwkNKVm_Bn5pqmRwTa3Gu0hs-EtMvz-jFpFDFFaky0ybumDoENq8N_70fASHyMXBcN21BciK2y6nlMof_7d8ypt3ZJ63zUwKFY6GsFZ_yqjcG9PnJJPMpewdN8LINgfcUurUIfC4Ez8IBMyvGMuHP5VRVXWH5Pq0FysY5N9eT61IVM8h5)"
