    }
    summary: "The \"linzixuanzz/daidai-panel\" project is a lightweight scheduled task management panel, similar to Qinglong Panel[1][2][3][4]. It offers features like task management, Open API, and Docker one-click deployment[4].\n\nRegarding the specific terms in your query:\n\n*   **\"api/v1\"**: The Daidai Panel uses `/api/v1/` for its API endpoints. For instance, `/api/v1/tasks/groups` is used for task groups, `/api/v1/mcp` for the MCP service, and `PUT /api/v1/envs/sort` and `PUT /api/v1/envs/:id` for environment variable operations[1]. The base path for scripts is equivalent to `/api/v1/...` and can be accessed via the `$DAIDAI_API_BASE` environment variable within scripts[5]. The Streamable HTTP connection for the MCP service is located at `http://<panel_address>/api/v1/mcp`[6][7].\n*   **\"open-api\"**: The Daidai Panel includes an \"Open API\" feature. This allows for integration with other tools and AI, enabling them to read documentation, create keys with permissions, and interact with the panel to write and execute scripts[4][8][9]. All MCP tool calls utilize the panel\'s Open API, and access to modules is determined by the application\'s permissions[6][7]. Every tool invocation is logged in the \"Open API\" page and counts towards the application\'s call frequency limit[7].\n*   **\"envs\"**: This term refers to environment variables within the Daidai Panel. The API includes endpoints for managing environment variables, such as `PUT /api/v1/envs/sort` and `PUT /api/v1/envs/:id`[1]. Environment variables can be precisely filtered by name, and the number of identical names can be displayed[4]. Scripts can also query environment variables, for example, using a function to retrieve an environment variable by name[5]. Applications with `envs` permission can directly access cleartext environment variables via the Open API[7]. The Docker deployment instructions for the Daidai Panel also specify environment variables like `TZ` (timezone) and `CONTAINER_NAME`[6][4][8].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHo_-ArIiNZxlhPx0Y5aZCA76mg3UD4wELyKDjovoq3LVl0pxDJEkZDjQWAoQsrI-uDYQQYbfchHBW8bNUg5nZQ8i1Uc2nBUm8MWZXyZUQJt4QZqX__GiGMeY_bE_BW_GGMUCSPoQ2EMYIiOuhab_E=)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYEHdKQ8iwGYAGEwqqcvJDBROKnF_mh2a2yf9-YG5hYw7H5Wq1wvr0e1lsOL950B3q4-Z7_aRiMCtagHNlSE0wJ6utmVHmFvqTxvURBVue_nE8XBKE7_0rQnfMHs_hcBrrLtGhYHAAkpzCpX2_Z8h4CO8vxOKbmn9ZE1ofAz0n36CK_uonU6VcIxU_ZT8=)\n[3] [keaix.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGNVnHvy2lSe0cMkjETjMrFNfTftol8k6lqxbP5gPA155gPbfd9NXSC5ZwF3SimP8mOOfWAyku73A_UrZmDrqXtgirVprjl1XU5PXP4WTi-RMhyviCT8bA2TnfRVA==)\n[4] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHT1DCmzrCuJkcCPx76TTFHi2OKV7_y9SkpqNC_lf9uNlTg9xP5GMuskkbBj0qRf0da3CCe7MueBcAIJd3NmKpHa60f89JqPpHfcxvPJ2bosrlx1jjmXG4pw2Nu7MkbhetswSxQSQQ=)\n[5] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHCfY6pH5_APs0z6yo0Xvz-SDiVOmbksSXmjJRw3Jbe4vapMKh-x9gNwxxlwYs-F0NfqlwPwU_bneQhWTWLkAX8e5hRUQ8SImLX6bymKAw6mkY_T3BT3qFXPJrkTj2OEjz2cD41k0isu03bnyP1tS2nZL9lFBfphppGizBhmo7-JnjOAg==)\n[6] [einverne.info](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEnHOuEaIk5Z3GN22Hs5HSRuhl-VDkOFGbbpXw00SYyTXp5Zpzc6-Y70EGLpBA_Nww68yF9G8WbH9i8mR1CznQgmzwh9G1VYh1GUQ_edOV-5bJFbIjC0Q5cQx6PFpCeyQn2XZeG_1HgKqWqOtLi5woJ6vFbYg==)\n[7] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGNbASfZEQ-01VDJ76jHQOmdSiRib7j4G49eU5AgbtXDYfxrWTVNmQFzudWypVb9OF7MvcdZB06RzIzLrU9BgTLC2zTW7vkydTWb0TwHTj6q-S-qdMUJAB0tuL0yGiuTwVq-X1ZVqr7CB9WhwP_1zQJnybGq16CQ3eWIqlz)\n[8] [tencent.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHm0p9T7cet1udqSTHt2FVhyM1nzPcznXeh9SCEQi9u5lwuOCzMmJsiKkjTNY4L-zUqzbOSVNYmmtaOnIoucRJWAuL8w4gGNqpyGUSPdmr9UDTvghgfynnOqok0BtXfFePBdmg30a7SZgvSruNguA==)\n[9] [smzdm.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGn9AcXCuzPS_Pj85ejlnmO7_LFabwIsMAq-12RuXJSxljtYpAS-AcgA_H1XmI7FGgCGzZT9NEoTr1_9q6c54FgTEbMwAqLuZgkAm5bONoc5YvK4fkohQebveVF7Ll-Rw==)"
