  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Component Library**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the application\'s components. Specifically, I\'m designing the `Header.tsx` file. The top bar will feature clean branding, including an icon, \"\345\221\206\345\221\206\345\220\214\346\255\245\", and a subtitle or indicator. I\'m also including an \"\345\256\211\350\243\205\345\210\260\346\241\214\351\235\242\" button for installable scenarios and Android APK deployment.\n\n\n**Designing Workspace View**\n\nI\'m now deep in the design of `WorkspaceView.tsx`. I\'ve added a config warning card that prompts one-click settings adjustments, if needed. I\'m also including an editable inline header for the target variable. My plan includes large, touch-friendly buttons for clipboard reading and clearing, plus a content preview with privacy toggle, helpers, and feedback.\n\n\n**Defining UI Components**\n\nMy current focus is on defining the UI components, moving beyond the workspace. I\'m deep diving into `EnvsListView.tsx`, aiming for a real-time, searchable list of environment variables. Each entry will feature actions like \"Set as Target.\" I\'m also planning `SettingsView.tsx` with inputs for URLs, keys, toggles, and connection testing, with live diagnostics. I\'m focusing on user experience, clarity, and helpful prompts.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_319820"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { Download, HelpCircle, CheckCircle2, AlertCircle } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { usePWAInstall } from \'../hooks/usePWAInstall\';\\n\\ninterface HeaderProps {\\n  isConfigured: boolean;\\n  onOpenGuide: () => void;\\n  onOpenSettings: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Header: React.FC<HeaderProps> = ({ isConfigured, onOpenGuide, onOpenSettings }) => {\\n  const { isInstallable, isInstalled, isIOS, install } = usePWAInstall();\\n  const [showIOSModal, setShowIOSModal] = React.useState(false);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"sticky top-0 z-30 bg-slate-900/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-800 px-4 py-3\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-2xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4\\\">\\n        {/* Brand Zone */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600 to-emerald-500 p-0.5 shadow-md shadow-blue-500/10 flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n            <img src=\\\"/icon.svg\\\" alt=\\\"App Logo\\\" className=\\\"w-full h-full rounded-[10px] object-cover\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-bold text-slate-100 text-base tracking-tight leading-none\\\">\345\221\206\345\221\206\345\220\214\346\255\245</span>\\n              {isInstalled && (\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-medium text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-800/60 rounded px-1.5 py-0.2\\\">\\n                  PWA\\n                </span>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-none mt-0.5\\\">\345\211\252\350\264\264\346\235\277\347\216\257\345\242\203\345\217\230\351\207\217\345\212\251\346\211\213</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Action Controls */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n          {/* PWA Install Button for Chromium/Android */}\\n          {isInstallable && (\\n            <button\\n              onClick={install}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white text-xs font-medium rounded-lg shadow-sm shadow-blue-600/30 transition-all active:scale-[0.98] min-h-[36px]\\\"\\n              title=\\\"\345\256\211\350\243\205\345\210\260\346\211\213\346\234\272\346\241\214\351\235\242\\\"\\n            >\\n              <Download className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n              <span>\345\256\211\350\243\205\345\272\224\347\224\250</span>\\n            </button>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* iOS Safari Install Button */}\\n          {isIOS && !isInstalled && (\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setShowIOSModal(true)}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 text-xs font-medium rounded-lg border border-slate-700 min-h-[36px]\\\"\\n            >\\n              <Download className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-400\\\" />\\n              <span>\345\256\211\350\243\205\345\210\260\346\241\214\351\235\242</span>\\n            </button>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* Connection Status Button */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenSettings}\\n            className={`flex items-center gap-1 text-xs px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border transition-colors min-h-[36px] ${\\n              isConfigured\\n                ? \'bg-slate-800/80 border-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-slate-100\'\\n                : \'bg-amber-950/40 border-amber-800/60 text-amber-300 hover:bg-amber-900/40\'\\n            }`}\\n            title={isConfigured ? \'\351\205\215\347\275\256\345\267\262\345\260\261\347\273\252\' : \'\350\257\267\345\211\215\345\276\200\350\256\276\347\275\256\351\205\215\347\275\256\345\221\206\345\221\206\351\235\242\346